T: Se Canta
O: Traditional Occitan
N: The unofficial anthem of Occitania, sung from the Pyrenees to Provence and
N: known by legend as the song of Gaston Febus (1331-1391), Count of Foix.
N: Melody and score from mamalisa.com (Monique Palomares), transposed up a fourth.
